    </div>
    <div class="b body-copy reveal">
      <p>Every project gets premium work, whatever its size. A panel change gets the same care as a full custom build. Most jobs are residential, and close to a third are commercial.</p>
      <p>Today HausPower partners with homeowners, architects, interior designers and builders across Toronto, Mississauga, Oakville, Kitchener and Waterloo. Follow recent work on Instagram at <a class="link link-ivory" href="{{ site.instagram }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ site.instagramHandle }}</a>.</p>
